  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In relation to admirals, I have a story to share that, despite its seemingly fanciful nature, is entirely true.",
      "output_sha256": "868b65236c9b077b4d34565e36e7bdf23609c2ea61b1aba618281d583f827383",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.355385,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f004172042c293614d49466648b3c46443690c4c007bec7764bcdbea5e80b86d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "868b65236c9b077b4d34565e36e7bdf23609c2ea61b1aba618281d583f827383",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Once upon a time there was an artist with historical leanings not unassociated with the desire for pelf—pelf being, even to idealists, what gasoline is to a car.",
      "output_sha256": "84b901afcce077ef56fd81121fa013056ced5dc26717fcffdbfe313ccfbe785f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "84b901afcce077ef56fd81121fa013056ced5dc26717fcffdbfe313ccfbe785f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The blend brought him one day to Portsmouth, where the Victory lies, with the honourable purpose of painting a picture of that famous ship with Nelson on board.",
      "output_sha256": "4f14d34de15bda19cc68e2256a2b41358fc8dac62fb9e014e86634757a55d624",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f14d34de15bda19cc68e2256a2b41358fc8dac62fb9e014e86634757a55d624",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Admiral was of course dying, and the meritorious intention of the artist, whose wife wanted some new curtains, was to make the work as attractive as might be and thus extract a little profit from the wave of naval enthusiasm which was then passing over the country; for not only was the picture itself to be saleable, but reproductions were to be made of it.",
      "output_sha256": "367c2b81d67b0f4c0238914864ab35bce23dd2fcaf5059ecb2eb2ed1c71a5c03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "367c2b81d67b0f4c0238914864ab35bce23dd2fcaf5059ecb2eb2ed1c71a5c03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Permission having been obtained from the authorities, the artist boarded the Victory , set up his easel on her deck, and settled down to his task, the monotony of which was pleasantly alleviated by the chatter of the old salts who guard the ship and act as guides to the tourists visiting her.",
      "output_sha256": "9ad5915b13227da20c7b5ce1d448baebc68e0fa817231e3651d1c98a21468679",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ad5915b13227da20c7b5ce1d448baebc68e0fa817231e3651d1c98a21468679",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "These seasoned gentlemen, convinced they had personally fought alongside Nelson and witnessed his demise, provided a wealth of opinions on art that were difficult to counter.",
      "output_sha256": "ca93700b17639dea2dc2d03daceead8581d7ab151356184e4a221a652b9fbd95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.302021,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "81e4b419246095b209cfb5530afd3e0cc8dfeb1e57c8d92596b6dc83bdf87896"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ca93700b17639dea2dc2d03daceead8581d7ab151356184e4a221a652b9fbd95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Thus, painting, conversing, and learning (as one can learn only from a trained imparter of information), three or four days passed quickly away and the picture was done.",
      "output_sha256": "60640e5033661aff05161f0f3b474c9b8e17165c35ae7ebed67b42ccbf885443",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "60640e5033661aff05161f0f3b474c9b8e17165c35ae7ebed67b42ccbf885443",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So far there has been nothing to strain credulity.",
      "output_sha256": "736fcc9912ef24520796a3c0181065a4179cad83390bd92145ccfec59c34c6a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "736fcc9912ef24520796a3c0181065a4179cad83390bd92145ccfec59c34c6a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But a time will come—is, in fact, upon us.",
      "output_sha256": "bbb5669dfae93a23c104768c301c8d37ea148c2e61825437c2952f1f312c659c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbb5669dfae93a23c104768c301c8d37ea148c2e61825437c2952f1f312c659c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "On the final evening of his stay, while enjoying an early dinner with a friend before catching a train back to London, the artist began discussing his recent work.",
      "output_sha256": "6c5b79537d129e8bcd171773999cacfd28abd0f572e23654c0de9eedab946199",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.474912,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bc3b482ca84b2fa4743dfa89d76e054a1ee4e7022b91d9d63b902f78e65fdb1e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6c5b79537d129e8bcd171773999cacfd28abd0f572e23654c0de9eedab946199",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He expressed satisfaction with it in the main, but could not, he said, help feeling that its chances of becoming a real success would be sensibly increased if he could find as a model for the central figure some one whose resemblance to Nelson was noticeable.",
      "output_sha256": "6d305a78adbfcd14a8908657138493c61b880e1a348a8566974ef09f7ca9b21a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d305a78adbfcd14a8908657138493c61b880e1a348a8566974ef09f7ca9b21a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"It seems to be a universal truth,\" he mused, \"that contemporaneous individuals cannot possess identical facial features.",
      "output_sha256": "1f3ad5b279f4c49b3aa2c0c335c5066859d6f6d7a9a29b258954ab0ac97c7469",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.348763,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cb7bf7074544ef9060c2d3e8d785d40319ab3782fc234a544e6ddc96efcc707e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1f3ad5b279f4c49b3aa2c0c335c5066859d6f6d7a9a29b258954ab0ac97c7469",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is an axiom.",
      "output_sha256": "c70b6a1d945da65b52fafb59ef2c3311facaa3b50393170ec800fdf604c4ab29",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "c70b6a1d945da65b52fafb59ef2c3311facaa3b50393170ec800fdf604c4ab29",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Strange as it may sound, among all the millions of countenances with two eyes, a nose in the middle and a mouth below it, no two precisely resemble each other.",
      "output_sha256": "2f50d07a7842283f85c96a2f5c41255ee9d66229b249cd6a87fef3aede4ff862",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "2f50d07a7842283f85c96a2f5c41255ee9d66229b249cd6a87fef3aede4ff862",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There are always subtle differences.\"",
      "output_sha256": "1ff09db184507544713769a4c6184b576dc256b007da1bedb76ea578e8bb792b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.58,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "711eafe019ff8b864f66eb678b9427b9cb2e314cda9e2e952dc112919e08c018"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1ff09db184507544713769a4c6184b576dc256b007da1bedb76ea578e8bb792b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At this point, he was relishing the sound of his own thoughts.",
      "output_sha256": "165990f95b779f441fd180b0601149872aa024c51b6c3421f34e5663b705544c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.496615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5ce7c6a8b69719c41291f3026697cd9207aa6d8bfd61baa097482a5ab5624d61"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "165990f95b779f441fd180b0601149872aa024c51b6c3421f34e5663b705544c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"That is, as I say, among contemporaries: in the world at the moment in which I am speaking.",
      "output_sha256": "10d608df681a1fa5966c76cee3e55e1c13d627225f66345fd3655b021e1f175e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "10d608df681a1fa5966c76cee3e55e1c13d627225f66345fd3655b021e1f175e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But,\" he continued, \"I see no reason why after the lapse of years Nature should not begin precisely to reproduce physiognomies and so save herself the trouble of for ever varying them.",
      "output_sha256": "d7143adf57834bac80f18f51932e6904f2b9d15667224208033e0d58ead50bb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7143adf57834bac80f18f51932e6904f2b9d15667224208033e0d58ead50bb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That being so, and surely the hypothesis is not too far-fetched\"—Here his friend said, \"No, not at all—oh no!\"—\"that being so, why,\" the artist continued, \"should there not be at this moment, more than a century later, some one whose resemblance to Nelson is exact?",
      "output_sha256": "486d91a02d6a0749361b2e7dee1d505c5c7e3b7d6fcc17b3fe4de79b0d5213e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "486d91a02d6a0749361b2e7dee1d505c5c7e3b7d6fcc17b3fe4de79b0d5213e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He would not be necessarily a naval man—probably, indeed, not, for Nelson's face was not characteristic of the sea—but whoever he was, even if he were an archbishop, I,\" said the painter firmly, \"should not hesitate to go up to him and ask him to sit to me.\"",
      "output_sha256": "1b03a91dbe8de49db141d09f07ffe663c8e3e61a3a10664a2eb53719bc3ff22e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b03a91dbe8de49db141d09f07ffe663c8e3e61a3a10664a2eb53719bc3ff22e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "His friend concurred that this was a commendable position to take, demonstrating the artist's genuine intent.",
      "output_sha256": "8cebe437fced1133ed7df2b38457a3184f295937d5e90a96b68afaa2719053ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.327778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a647dda85972a53046f0d7b1c89f88ecc00c30de8b9106120b77ac6ab321bec8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8cebe437fced1133ed7df2b38457a3184f295937d5e90a96b68afaa2719053ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Nelson's face,\" the painter continued, \"was an uncommon one.",
      "output_sha256": "449fdf50ba8641b7af0b3a9046eb3c43e8608343614d1a5dca5cad652b66b314",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "449fdf50ba8641b7af0b3a9046eb3c43e8608343614d1a5dca5cad652b66b314",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So large and so mobile a mouth is rare.",
      "output_sha256": "0d5e31ba46e7678d261e0e27e16110cea85c847e8cc574ca41c71d67ef545f0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d5e31ba46e7678d261e0e27e16110cea85c847e8cc574ca41c71d67ef545f0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, it is entirely plausible that a perfect doppelgänger exists, and no matter who he might be—even if he were an archbishop—I would unabashedly approach him and ask him to model for me.\"",
      "output_sha256": "44429c508f0fc86e1cb377390ffae07325bfe20163aac9742ba977aff4fef336",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.491337,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09733a0bd4936f4b027a9845c5c1f1a76e3324f28b8c10b7722e31f4ac071814"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44429c508f0fc86e1cb377390ffae07325bfe20163aac9742ba977aff4fef336",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "(For the benefit of any feminine reader of this veracious history, I should say that the repetition which she has just noticed is not a slip on my part but has been carefully set down.",
      "output_sha256": "d2ef42ee23f1ad9bd2e1c47844e119ba0adde5249b637d52aa9d4fa6348fd07e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2ef42ee23f1ad9bd2e1c47844e119ba0adde5249b637d52aa9d4fa6348fd07e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This stylistic choice aims to lend authenticity to the dialogue, as men often repeat themselves in conversation.)",
      "output_sha256": "d0143ae1286ee54bcdc232c240cea6a9a19d05b9e6cf7acf08fe9335a4f4a4d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.286642,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "23922df9b0977ed0eb7fe48cba9eeeeab5ea9f63edec95da426c4fbd91e54337"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d0143ae1286ee54bcdc232c240cea6a9a19d05b9e6cf7acf08fe9335a4f4a4d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The friend again remarked that the painter's resolve did him infinite credit, and the two started for the station, still conversing on this theme.",
      "output_sha256": "ec67bf05136cb7ac719aa3bd23af103d8dc70a0827d7dc3a6c717edcd21d794a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec67bf05136cb7ac719aa3bd23af103d8dc70a0827d7dc3a6c717edcd21d794a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On entering their carriage the first thing to take their attention was a quiet little man in black, who was the absolute double of the hero of Trafalgar.",
      "output_sha256": "cfff70d0bc5ef9dbfc56aaf479db4dbf62e596ba90d5d1cbd7f9a132ef0bb6a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "cfff70d0bc5ef9dbfc56aaf479db4dbf62e596ba90d5d1cbd7f9a132ef0bb6a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Good gracious!\" whispered the painter excitedly, \"do you see that?",
      "output_sha256": "d5714178a46660267001368904153ccd5ef740bda76d362569c63218c7140232",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "d5714178a46660267001368904153ccd5ef740bda76d362569c63218c7140232",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There’s the very man!",
      "output_sha256": "9a5c8439f5da92530f07610d61141b3af12e21a6e182a3ebca9988871b05c0b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.6875,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5e4bfa413de7e39697987384336f1303eeb02e1aca1cf7452ed176784ec566be"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9a5c8439f5da92530f07610d61141b3af12e21a6e182a3ebca9988871b05c0b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The likeness to Nelson is astonishing.",
      "output_sha256": "bb177e5abc9ef1aac229fb357adb4cb013b109fe60dcdfb3d4b0e2d696495c5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb177e5abc9ef1aac229fb357adb4cb013b109fe60dcdfb3d4b0e2d696495c5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I’ve never seen anything quite like it.",
      "output_sha256": "cf3c4a6ff701b4492683b34b33a3cad962839bb1b4e3b4513ebf8977e88097b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.601923,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0b09be9c88d37c904af6f9591bf082f1255be6bcf2806af9f8dc9116f3b6eb52"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cf3c4a6ff701b4492683b34b33a3cad962839bb1b4e3b4513ebf8977e88097b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I don't care who he is, I must tackle him.",
      "output_sha256": "e4416cca58570533c953c2a2044093ca47a8125fb497adab068f1b27e9909bdb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4416cca58570533c953c2a2044093ca47a8125fb497adab068f1b27e9909bdb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It's the most extraordinary chance that ever occurred.\"",
      "output_sha256": "7337598044b8dd188d27d8acbffc381b913cceb14c42d3b23639a6a245ee8f5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "7337598044b8dd188d27d8acbffc381b913cceb14c42d3b23639a6a245ee8f5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Adopting a particularly suave and respectful demeanor—after all, while the man didn’t appear to be an archbishop, he could still hold some significance—the painter approached the stranger and presented his business card.",
      "output_sha256": "8b8e21200761b55649a0cd556ed1e850a3dc0772629e8c2cd49fddf3ba9087d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.368987,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ad8f5b31f3fcfa39e265f455cd8a905ab97df65d7d27331d7ade664a402a6fb0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8b8e21200761b55649a0cd556ed1e850a3dc0772629e8c2cd49fddf3ba9087d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Excuse my boldness, sir,\" he began, \"but I am an artist currently working on a painting of Nelson aboard the Victory.",
      "output_sha256": "22e8ec6296a5b01f9e79d4f42422f4e9bf77eafee96b71054798b32c96b654f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.48886,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3db58a1f970764fc7d3891399a34533a0c26ab22184f37fb7d7495e666293ad3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "22e8ec6296a5b01f9e79d4f42422f4e9bf77eafee96b71054798b32c96b654f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have all the accessories and so forth, but what I very seriously need is a brief sitting from some gentleman with a likeness to the great Admiral.",
      "output_sha256": "e5dc9831dac8267ca5c9d97f02e9f818703d0f74389ebb8a34510af2a54fd58a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "e5dc9831dac8267ca5c9d97f02e9f818703d0f74389ebb8a34510af2a54fd58a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Such, sir, as yourself.",
      "output_sha256": "94e3045e48723de4019aa533fc26352d6c1a2906a9d03068322cee7520af3c27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "94e3045e48723de4019aa533fc26352d6c1a2906a9d03068322cee7520af3c27",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It may come as a surprise, but you, sir, are so strikingly similar to the illustrious warrior that it quite takes one's breath away.",
      "output_sha256": "6ee06f21cf28abf0b222db6512f90fd838daf28a94b73b11480dc935b6b4e1fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.478571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3f022cbc62265820d40feda395fa96d3e21f5fc1a39bbd16c4bfc48cfbe382a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6ee06f21cf28abf0b222db6512f90fd838daf28a94b73b11480dc935b6b4e1fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is astonishing, wonderful!",
      "output_sha256": "ad8e0f7086daaac3c17dba51819ccf81d54f40702fd8bbd20d5872208d9cbf42",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "ad8e0f7086daaac3c17dba51819ccf81d54f40702fd8bbd20d5872208d9cbf42",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Might I—would it be—could you—would you, sir, be so very kind as to allow me to paint you?",
      "output_sha256": "3e6c3da1d2400f8f7a1cf477446a946b6108ba46650e1a78b8259c8c0c3fa248",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e6c3da1d2400f8f7a1cf477446a946b6108ba46650e1a78b8259c8c0c3fa248",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I would, of course, make every effort not to inconvenience you—I would arrange so that your time should be mine.\"",
      "output_sha256": "9862d6545f7c9b30651e6dcc5425793468149c2dd5de26ae975b746ae2689a33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "9862d6545f7c9b30651e6dcc5425793468149c2dd5de26ae975b746ae2689a33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Of course, I will,\" replied the man.",
      "output_sha256": "0b670e78d3407ddb3c8f2d7891f8d2c8576ad131b3f8a71250e10ae67a775abe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0b8f849cfea297796628c536ec178b66fad404dc90c23439083b5202202a022b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0b670e78d3407ddb3c8f2d7891f8d2c8576ad131b3f8a71250e10ae67a775abe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Being a professional model, I've been sitting for Nelson for years.",
      "output_sha256": "7034c7c6b700e2b192725f01b61c38d3960486fceaa4dd9e333feb27245e7738",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "7034c7c6b700e2b192725f01b61c38d3960486fceaa4dd9e333feb27245e7738",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, I've been doing it for an artist this very afternoon.\"",
      "output_sha256": "3e8a6a6138305cee6dccfdebcb62535c2566b4b30a7cd929a935853c022f4328",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e8a6a6138305cee6dccfdebcb62535c2566b4b30a7cd929a935853c022f4328",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
